update content_bodies set title = '【熊本北阿蘇観光】阿蘇の観光はこれで決まり！遊び尽くす大満喫の旅！【旅する北阿蘇総集編！】4K ver.', description = 'この動画は、熊本の北阿蘇を巡る旅の総集編です。小国町から始まり、鍋ヶ滝での深呼吸や杖立温泉での蒸し体験、旧宮原線遊歩道の散策など、多彩な観光スポットを紹介しています。南小国町では、押戸石の丘での神秘体験や黒川温泉での入浴、阿蘇りんどうポークの試食など、地域の魅力を満喫できます。また、産山村ではうぶやま牧場での買い物や幻想的な山吹水源の景色を楽しむことができます。全体を通して、阿蘇地域の自然美と文化体験を豊かに探求する内容となっています。' where id = 'LkIOY8CCH_qTT9qd97zvj';
update content_bodies set title = 'Kumamoto North Aso Tourism: The Ultimate Guide to Enjoying Aso! A Comprehensive Travel Compilation of North Aso! 4K Version', description = 'This video showcases a comprehensive travel guide to North Aso, starting with Oguni Town. It features various attractions such as Nabegataki Waterfall, where visitors can take a deep breath, and the steam experience at Kurokawa Onsen. The journey includes stops at local stations, historical sites, and scenic walks along the old Miyahara Line. The video also highlights unique experiences like the mystical Oshiishi Hill, delicious local cuisine including Aso Rindou Pork, and the breathtaking views of the grassland terrace in Minamioguni Town. The adventure continues in Ubuyama Village with shopping at Ubuyama Farm and enjoying the picturesque scenery at the Yamakubo Water Source. Overall, it presents a rich exploration of the natural beauty and cultural experiences in the Aso region.' where id = 'kFPETftUpFxADFzCZGY7I';
update content_bodies set title = '人が、時間が、きよらかな郷。南小国', description = '阿蘇郡の南小国町は、黒川温泉や田の原温泉、小田温泉など、多くの温泉地を有しています。この動画では、里山の風景を守る人々や、お客様を迎える人々の姿を紹介しています。人々が作り出す懐かしく温かい雰囲気が感じられ、ほっと落ち着く時間を過ごすことができます。' where id = 'Fajil_6hJwKXKYgOeLjdk';
update content_bodies set title = 'A Clear Village of People and Time: Minamioguni', description = 'Minamioguni Town in Aso District boasts numerous hot spring areas, including Kurokawa Onsen, Tanahara Onsen, and Oda Onsen. This video introduces the people who preserve the rural landscape and those who welcome visitors. It captures the nostalgic and warm atmosphere created by the community. Come and spend a relaxing time in this serene environment.' where id = 'aZYZQr06K3bhHhceWHJ1K';
