update content_bodies set title = '丹波、収穫の地', description = '関西は、日本の精神性と文化を深く広く体験できる場所です。1800年以上前の古代文明から、修験道や禅、京都を代表する華やかな平安貴族文化、さらには城や武士道、忍者に至るまで、関西は日本文化の全ての側面を網羅しています。' where id = 'JizfzHubeq-gscxtRA2xc';
update content_bodies set title = 'TAMBA, The Land of Harvest', description = 'Kansai is a region rich in Japanese spirituality and culture, offering a deep exploration of its historical and cultural aspects. With a civilization that dates back over 1,800 years, Kansai encompasses various cultural elements, including Shugendo, Zen, and the opulent Heian aristocratic culture epitomized by Kyoto. Additionally, it is home to castles, the samurai code of bushido, and the intriguing world of ninjas, making it a comprehensive representation of Japanese heritage.' where id = 'SUqBZx_fsGANS3qHx-FJd';
